daemontools
===========

The remaining FreshPorts services: fp-daemon and ingress_svn.

This repository was converted from the daemontools project in the
freshports-1 Subversion repository (svn+ssh://svn.int.unixathome.org/
freshports-1); see README.md for that conversion. Three of its services
have since been split into repositories of their own, by
split-daemontools.sh in ~/src/freshports/git-conversion/.


What moved
----------

  directory     new repository                 FreeBSD package
  -----------   ----------------------------   -----------------------
  freshports/   FreshPorts/daemon-freshports   freshports-freshports
  ingress/      FreshPorts/daemon-ingress      freshports-ingress
  fp-listen/    FreshPorts/fp-listen           py-freshports-fp-listen

FreshPorts/fp-listen replaces an earlier conversion, now
FreshPorts/archive.fp-listen, which despite its name held all of
daemontools as of 2024-11-07.

Each is built and distributed as a separate package, so each now has its
own repository and its own tags. Their history went with them, following
each directory through its earlier names (fp-daemon, fp-freshports,
fp-ingress); see the README in each new repository.

The history here is not rewritten. fp-daemon and ingress_svn descend from
the same code (trunk/freshports, then trunk/fp-daemon), so removing the
moved directories from all history would remove their past too. Instead,
one commit on main removes freshports/, ingress/ and fp-listen/; the
older commits still contain them.


Tags
----

The 56 tags for the moved services are deleted from this repository; each
release now exists in one place only:

  deleted here                            now in
  -------------------------------------   -------------------------------
  fp-freshports-2.0.0 .. 2.0.5            daemon-freshports 2.0.0 .. 2.0.5
  freshports-2.0.6 .. 2.0.16              daemon-freshports 2.0.6 .. 2.0.16
  fp-ingress-2.0.0 .. 2.0.2               daemon-ingress 2.0.0 .. 2.0.2
  ingress-2.0.3, 2.0.4                    daemon-ingress 2.0.3, 2.0.4
  fp-listen-1.0.0 .. 1.3.4 (21 tags)      fp-listen, same names
  fp-listen-git-1.0.0 .. 1.0.9            fp-listen, same names
  fp-listen-2.0.0 .. 2.0.2                fp-listen 2.0.0 .. 2.0.2

These 22 tags remain:

  fp-daemon-1.0.0 .. 1.0.3, fp-daemon-git-1.0.0
  ingress_svn-1.0.0 .. 1.0.11
  1.0.0, 1.0.1, FreshPorts-VuXML
  freshports-services-1.0.2
  freshports-services-   (named so in SVN, r5030; kept as is)


Branches
--------

  main          daemontools/branches/git
  trunk         daemontools/trunk
  FreshPorts2   daemontools/branches/FreshPorts2

All three are unchanged by the split, apart from the one removal commit
on main.
